effects crew  gleefully blowing stuff  up elsewhere there are several  intriguing looks at new members of the  suicide squad team  gun teases a wild cgi version of weasel  played by his brother sean gunn  michael rooker is sporting a crazy  blonde wig of savant  and john cena makes his first appearance  as peacemaker not everyone on the  suicide squad roster makes an appearance  in the promo footage but we know almost  all the facts about the cast  gun has assembled an absolutely mammoth  group of actors for the suicide squad  there are several actors reprising their  roles from david ayres original suicide  squad  margot robbie returns as harley quinn as  does joel kinnaman is rick flagg  viola davis is amanda waller and jai  courtney is captain boomerang  it doesn't stop there either we're also  getting daniela melchior as rat catcher  2  nathan phillian is tdk alicia braga as  solsoria plula borg as javelin and pete  davidson as blackguard  and still the cast goes on an  interesting side note about one of the  cast members  idris elbow was initially in talks to  play dead shot when will smith had to  drop out of the roll  we're very curious to see what elba's  take on bloodsport looks like as a  result  one thing you'll notice from the cast  reveal trailer is that there is one star  whose suicide squad role hasn't been  announced yet  taika ytt we can't wait to see what  character the what we do in the shadows  actor is going to play and what is sure  to be the most insane superhero movie  ever made  the suicide squad is set for release on  august 6 2021  so fans should get plenty more  information about the movie between now  and then  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  the dc fan dome and the suicide squad  are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one
 

